rrr|n|Any porous substance, as cloth, paper, sand, or charcoal, through which water or other liquid may passed to cleanse it from the solid or impure matter held in suspension; a chamber or device containing such substance; a strainer; also, a similar device for purifying air. ; To purify or defecate, as water or other liquid, by causing it to pass through a filter. ; Same as Philter.	n:aqc,67,5;1td,61,12~1td,61,12;aqc,67,5	N:y5e,76,6;aki,72,3~y5e,76,6;aki,72,3
